<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan foreign exchange market was closed for trading due to Good Friday holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Sri Lankan rupee closed lower at 58.20 to the dollar due to speculative demand for the greenback.</p>
